WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.105 --> 00:00:02.772
(intense music)

00:00:04.043 --> 00:00:06.737
- [Voiceover] Bicycle kicks,

00:00:06.737 --> 00:00:07.714
spikes,

00:00:07.714 --> 00:00:10.031
and flips all off a giant trampoline

00:00:10.031 --> 00:00:11.903
while the referee plays music.

00:00:11.903 --> 00:00:13.775
This is bossaball,

00:00:13.775 --> 00:00:15.077
a sport with Spanish origins

00:00:15.077 --> 00:00:16.381
it has gained a big following

00:00:16.381 --> 00:00:18.788
with the youth in Colombia.

00:00:18.788 --> 00:00:20.798
(speaking foreign language)

00:01:18.433 --> 00:01:19.266
- [Voiceover] In Bogata,

00:01:19.266 --> 00:01:20.958
the government has funded
a bossaball program

00:01:20.958 --> 00:01:22.137
for at risk youth

00:01:22.137 --> 00:01:23.235
to teach them the game

00:01:23.235 --> 00:01:26.692
and keep them off the streets
and away from violence.

00:02:10.462 --> 00:02:13.045
(upbeat music)

